values of a function $h$ on the set $T = {-3,-1, 0, 2, 5}$. Compute the following:\n\n$max_(t ∈ T)h(t) =$\n{{field-1}} $\\arg max_(t ∈ T)h(t) =$\n{{field-2}} $min_(t ∈ T)h(t) =$\n{{field-3}} $\\arg min_(t ∈ T)h(t) =$\n{{field-4}}"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231741 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186231454 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "23320907-6b2d-5956-82ab-fdd5c5014613" :knowledge-point/title "Reading Argmax and Argmin From a Graph"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/id #uuid "a24cb5dd-80bb-5dfe-83bc-4226c4aaf5a2" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231032} {:answer-field/id #uuid "f70ce8fd-189c-54b2-92fa-7acb7f8e964c" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231033} {:answer-field/id #uuid "001bd4eb-aa7e-5b93-84f5-49f05f38bb35" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231034} {:answer-field/id #uuid "57ed5c0d-d701-5367-a66e-0c1a2e4ea2f4" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186231035}] :question/id #uuid "b91c7e10-040a-5e56-8c03-d9cec7fb5abc" :question/math-academy-id "q-355232" :question/problem "![](images/af/af893cca4e4fe3d4b62f02997fa799dec3e35fbe8942d2d3c90d2eeb6bbc919c.png)\n\nLet $T = {-3,-2, 0, 1, 3}$. The graph above shows the value of $g(x)$ for each $x ∈ T$. Assuming that all the dots have integer coordinates, compute the following:\n\n$max_(x ∈ T)g(x) =$\n{{field-1}} $\\arg max_(x ∈ T)g(x) =$\n{{field-2}} $min_(x ∈ T)g(x) =$\n{{field-3}} $\\arg min_(x ∈ T)g(x) =$\n{{field-4}}"}]}
